{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113103104904-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113103546\"/><p>銀線灣泳灘泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（11月13日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該3處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該3處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:43:48.639267+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:31:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T09:32:31.156315+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:37:21.234828+00:00","content_hash":"469f3d4ab76ed48abf13f75875e490c4d701e94bed115d267128b1ad54dcda17","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:43:48.639267+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}